IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
User nathankamgangmel@gmail.com
PassCmd "python3 /usr/share/neomutt/oauth2/mutt_oauth2.py ~/.mutt/gmail.oauth2"
AuthMechs XOAUTH2
TLSType IMAPS
PipelineDepth 50

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

MaildirStore gmail-local
Path ~/.mail/gmail/
Inbox ~/.mail/gmail/Inbox
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Patterns * !"[Gmail]/All Mail" !"[Gmail]/Important" !"[Gmail]/Chats"
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

